{"id":"tam","lemma":"там","pos":"adv","rank":54,"glosses":["there","used to reference another topic in a list; next, then, else"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/d5/Ru-%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BC.ogg/Ru-%D1%82%D0%B0%D0%BC.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Кого вы там видели?","en":"Who did you see there?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283398","words":[{"g":"who","l":"кто"},{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null,{"g":"to see","l":"видеть"}]},{"text":"Я был там.","en":"I was there.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/152568","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"was","l":"быть"},null]},{"text":"Том тоже там будет?","en":"Will Tom also be there?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283483","words":[{"g":"that one, those ones","l":"тот"},{"g":"also"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"быть"}]},{"text":"Он там?","en":"Is it there?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/928207","words":[{"g":"he / it"},null]},{"text":"Тебе надо там быть.","en":"You should be there.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283466","words":[{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},{"g":"must, necessary"},null,{"g":"to be"}]}]}